BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 60 740 Td (KESTREL LABS - IT SECURITY POLICY) Tj T* (Fictional policy written for the DocuMind evaluation set. Free to share.) Tj T* () Tj T* (1. Scope) Tj T* (This policy applies to every laptop, phone and cloud account used for Kestrel Labs) Tj T* (work, including personal devices that access company email.) Tj T* () Tj T* (2. Device security) Tj T* (Company laptops must use full-disk encryption and lock automatically after 5 minutes) Tj T* (of inactivity. Operating system security updates must be installed within 7 days of) Tj T* (release.) Tj T* ET
