BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 60 740 Td (3. Passwords and authentication) Tj T* (Passwords must be at least 14 characters long. Password reuse across services is not) Tj T* (allowed, and every employee must use the company password manager. Multi-factor) Tj T* (authentication is mandatory for email, source code hosting and the HR portal.) Tj T* (Hardware security keys are issued to administrators.) Tj T* () Tj T* (4. Reporting incidents) Tj T* (Suspected security incidents, including lost devices and phishing emails, must be) Tj T* (reported to security@kestrel.example within 1 hour of discovery. Do not try to) Tj T* (investigate an incident yourself.) Tj T* ET
