BT /F1 11 Tf 14 TL 60 740 Td (5. Data classification) Tj T* (Data is classified as Public, Internal, Confidential or Restricted. Restricted data,) Tj T* (such as customer payment details, may only be stored in approved systems and must) Tj T* (never be sent by email.) Tj T* () Tj T* (6. Access reviews) Tj T* (Managers review their team's access rights every 90 days. Accounts of employees who) Tj T* (leave the company are disabled on their last working day.) Tj T* ET
